ing-driven.\r\n\r\nHowever, I'm afraid we would not resort to the former as **members have agreed with using *annotations* over keywords for modifying grammars (except `static`). to keep compatibility and, more important, performance.** \r\n\r\n# Progress\r\n\r\n- [x] Remaster the codes\r\n- [x] Fix no warning when the current class has the same private member as the accessed class that is not the super class of the current class.\r\n- [x] Unit test\r\n\r\n# About the cesasion of this PR\r\n1. The real job takes me much much time from this, which is unavoidable.\r\n2. I'm not in major of computer programming, nor am I expert in the structure of GDScript module.\r\n3. The code I have wrote is total a mess and is not a better structure.\r\n4. Perhaps no implementation on private access for dynamic language like GDScript is the best solution.","closed_by":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103768/reactions","total_count"